<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia MBF Capital 6-mth net up 40 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia MBF Capital 6-mth net up 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 135.54    vs	  96.74</p>
<p>    Group shr   (cents)     17.4     vs	  12.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		   862.72    vs	 658.41</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   195.28    vs	 144.23</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less    0.44    vs  less   2.65</p>
<p>    Dividend    (cents)	2.0     vs	   2.0</p>
<p>NOTE - MBF Capital Berhad is a financial services company with units in consumer finance, stockbroking, credit cards, unit trust management, leasing and factoring and insurance.</p>
</text>
